# Universal Agent Instructions
Analyze and obey these constraints before proposing or editing code:
- `AGENTS.md` (repository workflow, including documentation synchronization)
- `.antigravity/rules/01_architecture.md` (Data Isolation & Caching)
- `.antigravity/rules/02_security.md` (Image Pipelines & Security boundaries)
Core Absolute Directive: Do not pollute UI/HTML views with direct database client logic. Keep all data connections encapsulated inside `js/supabase-config.js`.

Periodic Update Rule: When updating system documentation or rules, always refactor existing lines rather than appending new ones. Maintain a strict hard ceiling of 500 lines per file to prevent hallucination.
